OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who killed aunt to remain in
OL,4,Apsychiatric hospital for treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who killed her elderly aunt is
OL,7,Fto remain in hospital.
OL,9,FLouise Markson, 52, fatally attacked
OL,10,FSusan Sergison at her home in Hamilton,
OL,11,FSouth Lanarkshire, in January 2025.
OL,13,FShe is alleged to have struck her aunt
OL,14,Fwith blunt and sharp-edged implements,
OL,15,Fa mug and a pen while also stamping on
OL,16,Fher and kicking her.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
