OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who killed aunt to remain in
OL,4,Apsychiatric hospital for treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarkson, from Wishaw, North
OL,7,FLanarkshire, originally faced a charge
OL,8,Fof murdering Sergison, but last month
OL,9,Fwas deemed to be unfit to stand trial
OL,10,Fdue to a mental illness. She will be
OL,11,Fkept in the State Hospital at Carstairs
OL,12,Ffor treatment as part of an interim
OL,13,Fcompulsion order.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
